- Apa?
- Dia menggantikanmu.

727
00:46:18,154 --> 00:46:19,530
Bisa kita segera berangkat?

728
00:46:19,697 --> 00:46:23,492
Aku ingin melakukan protes di depan
kedutaan besar sebelum makan malam.

729
00:46:23,659 --> 00:46:26,120
Itu tindakan patriotis.
Mari naik ke bis.

730
00:46:28,080 --> 00:46:31,375
Fokus.
Topik berikutnya Bulan di Saturn.

731
00:46:31,834 --> 00:46:33,461
Hukum kedua thermodinamika.

732
00:46:34,003 --> 00:46:35,921
- Frank Sinatra.
- Fort Sumter.

733
00:46:36,630 --> 00:46:38,924
- Flash salah.
- Baik, fokus. Berikutnya.

734
00:46:39,091 --> 00:46:40,426
Liz, jangan memaksa mereka.

735
00:46:40,926 --> 00:46:42,636
Strontium, barium, vibranium.

736
00:46:42,803 --> 00:46:44,680
Bagus, Peter.
Senang kau kembali.

737
00:46:44,847 --> 00:46:46,307
Senang bisa kembali.

738
00:46:47,141 --> 00:46:50,144
- Apa satuan standar...?
- Boleh kuterima telepon sebentar?

739
00:46:50,311 --> 00:46:51,812
Ya, baik.

740
00:46:51,979 --> 00:46:53,773
- Halo?
- Layarku berkedip.

741
00:46:53,939 --> 00:46:54,982
Kau meninggalkan New York?

742
00:46:55,149 --> 00:46:56,776
- Baik, fokus, Semua.
- Pelacak.

743
00:46:56,942 --> 00:46:59,070
Ya, ini hanya perjalanan sekolah.
Bukan apa-apa.

744
